paras.en:
At last he wiped the pure sweat of the forehead with a finger;
the new moon removed the stars from the sun.
In the lips and accent of Haidar he called to the army:
“O heedless ones! Become aware of our rank.
We are servants of God but we are not God;
yet by God, servants such as we are do not exist.”

On the path of the Worshipped we do not keep a head on the body;
in giving our heads away we have no equal.
We keep gold nowhere except in the beggar’s hand;
our reliance is on the mercy of the Truth, we keep no bed.
This has been revealed to those who are the chosen of God,
that we are the releasers and untiers of the knots of every servant.

The commands of Yazid are one thing and our affairs another;
the show of falsehood is one thing and the appearance of truth another;
the fire of Nimrod is one thing and the fire of Tur another;
the buzz of a hornet is one thing and the melodies of the Psalms another.
Do understand what a human being is, what an angel is,
what an idol is, what God is, what the earth is, what the sky is.
